#: ../../source/get-help/community-chat.rst:42
msgid ""
"There are many channels that specialize in different areas of the "
"Mattermost platform. To find and join them, search “**Developers:**” in "
"the `LHS <https://handbook.mattermost.com/company/about-mattermost/list-"
"of-terms#lhs>`__ “🔍 Find channel” search bar on the community server."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 플랫폼의 다양한 영역을 전문으로 다루는 채널이 많이 있습니다. 채널을 "
"찾아 참여하려면 커뮤니티 서버의 `LHS "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/company/about-mattermost/list-"
"of-terms#lhs>`__ “🔍 Find channel” 검색창에서 “**Developers:**”를 검색하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/community-chat.rst:44
msgid ""
"We hold a public developer community meeting every Wednesday at 8:30 AM "
"Palo Alto time. ☎️ The meeting is held via an audio call in `Developers: "
"Meeting <https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/developers-"
"meeting>`__ and everyone is welcome. This weekly meeting is a great "
"opportunity to ask questions about the project and get involved."
msgstr ""
"매주 수요일 오전 8시 30분(팰로앨토 시간)에 공개 개발자 커뮤니티 미팅을 엽니다. ☎️ "
"미팅은 `Developers: Meeting "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/developers-meeting>`__ "
"채널의 음성 통화로 진행되며 누구나 참여할 수 있습니다. 이 주간 미팅은 프로젝트에 "
"대해 질문하고 참여를 시작할 좋은 기회입니다."

